=== small response
POST content-type=Some("application/json")
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"getstandardfee","params":[],"id":1}
---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
connection: close
content-length: 66

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"standard_fee":400,"version":0}}

=== oversized response
POST content-type=Some("application/json")
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"rpc.discover","params":[],"id":1}
---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
connection: close
content-length: 115

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"error":{"code":-32008,"message":"Response is too big","data":"Exceeded max limit of 300"}}

=== oversized bitcoind response
POST content-type=Some("application/json")
{"method":"rpc.discover","params":[],"id":1}
---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
connection: close
content-length: 113

{"id":1,"result":null,"error":{"code":-32008,"message":"Response is too big","data":"Exceeded max limit of 300"}}

=== batch under the limit
POST content-type=Some("application/json")
[{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"getstandardfee","params":[],"id":1},{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"getstandardfee","params":[],"id":2}]
---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
connection: close
content-length: 135

[{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"standard_fee":400,"version":0}},{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"standard_fee":400,"version":0}}]

=== oversized batch response
POST content-type=Some("application/json")
<631 bytes>
---
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
connection: close
content-length: 131

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":null,"error":{"code":-32011,"message":"The batch response was too large","data":"Exceeded max limit of 300"}}

=== batch with an oversized entry
